                            <comment id="15746264" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 13 Dec 2016 21:03:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user reddycharan opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/bookkeeper/pull/92&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/bookkeeper/pull/92&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-986&quot; title=&quot;Handle Memtable flush failure&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;BOOKKEEPER-986&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;BOOKKEEPER-986&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Handle memtable flush failure&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If the memtable flush is failed previously then&lt;br/&gt;
    for the next addEntry call it will try to flush the&lt;br/&gt;
    existing snapshot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


